<header><p class="st-kicker">republic · Anatolia and the Levant</p><h1 class="st-title">Lebanon</h1><p class="st-meta">1943 CE – present · capital Beirut</p></header>
<p class="st-teaser">The Mediterranean republic of many faiths, independent of France in 1943, prosperous, then torn by civil war and its neighbours' quarrels.</p>
<div class="st-body"><div class="st-text"><h2>Origins</h2><p>France shaped <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/greater-lebanon">Greater Lebanon</a> around Mount Lebanon in 1920 within its <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/french-mandate-for-syria-and-the-lebanon">mandate for Syria and the Lebanon</a>. The unwritten National Pact of 1943 divided power among Maronite, Sunni and Shia communities, and independence was won that November when France, under popular and British pressure, released the government it had arrested.</p><h2>Rule and society</h2><p>Beirut became the banking house and entrepot of the Arab east while a confessional parliament balanced eighteen recognised communities. The arrival of Palestinian refugees and later the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/palestine-liberation-organization">PLO</a>, and the grievances of a growing Shia south, strained the Pact until civil war broke out in 1975, drawing in Syria and Israel for fifteen years.</p><h2>To the present</h2><p>The Taif Agreement of 1989 rebalanced the republic and ended the war; Syrian forces left in 2005 after Rafic Hariri's assassination, and Hezbollah fought Israel again in 2006. Financial collapse after 2019 and the Beirut port explosion of 2020 left the confessional state in its deepest crisis since the war.</p></div><aside class="st-side"><div class="st-emblem" role="img" aria-label="republic, 1943 CE – present"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 38 L50 20 L80 38 Z"/><path d="M24 42 H76 M24 80 H76"/><path d="M30 44 V78 M43 44 V78 M57 44 V78 M70 44 V78"/></svg><p class="st-emblem-type">republic</p><p class="st-emblem-region">Anatolia and the Levant</p><div class="st-span" aria-hidden="true"><span class="st-span-bar" style="left:98.37%;width:1.63%"></span></div><div class="st-span-axis" aria-hidden="true"><span>3000 BCE</span><span>1 CE</span><span>2000</span></div></div><dl class="st-facts"><dt>Years</dt><dd>1943 CE – present</dd><dt>Centuries</dt><dd